# Netlify redirect rules for the static export in `out/`.
# See https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/

# The Articles section was renamed to Blog. Keep old links and search results
# working.
/articles     /blog/     301
/articles/*   /blog/:splat   301

# The community page moved to its own site. Forced (`!`) so the rule wins over
# the statically exported page that still exists in `out/community/`.
/community    https://quantumx.community/   301!
/community/*  https://quantumx.community/   301!
